    LLM: 'Focus on capturing cards that sum to 15. Try to capture the settebello (7 of coins) and accumulate sevens. Watch for opportunities to make an escoba (sweep).\n\nCount cards to track what values remain. Set up escoba opportunities by leaving specific card combinations on the table. Declare bonuses when you have qualifying combinations in hand.\n\nComplex probability calculations for capture opportunities. Strategic use of declaration bonuses. Control table state to limit opponent escoba chances while maximizing your own. Track suit distribution for primiera and coins majority.',
